# B1 v4 independent final-slot review

**HOLD final activation.** Four original PURE identity controls pass, and fresh309 source/1012 emitted files, authenticated1014-member producer inventory/package2fe,2274 regular tools+12links,45 runtime/5 publisher/1preimport pins and both independent acceptance receipts matched. No product/Worker/compiler/install/native execution.

## F01: future preimport still has the nested-array defect

/Users/kjopek/Workspace/safe-bash/tests/integration/agent-bash-coherent-author-20260829/stage-b1-final-binding-v3/preimport.mjs:29

```js
for (const entry of [...packet.publisherFiles, packet.preimportFiles]) read(entry.path, entry.sha256, entry.bytes, 131072);
```

Bound hash 4bcd89b4f43e51380f0f12baccc1e7d25f39e0b44541cb2e7f721d4dc044dd76. Preparation correctly uses ...preimportFiles, but the future helper has five publisher records followed by one ARRAY. The sixth iteration reads undefined entry.path and calls fs.lstatSync(undefined); source catch maps the error to78 before writing PUBLICATION-AUTHORITY-v3.json. This is source/DATA proof, not an actual preimport run or product failure. A minimal separately versioned helper/packet rebind and different review are required before ROOT can consider actual GO.

The identity validator's Object.keys also does not enforce absence of hidden/symbol own keys; its four controls establish the narrower tested enumerable-own-data profile, not all-own-key exactness.

## Authority and accounting
Issued 2026-08-29T13:45:11.543Z; latest start 2026-08-29T14:05:11.543Z; expiry 2026-08-29T14:35:11.543Z. All12 actual slots remained absent at 2026-08-29T13:57:49.691Z, but freshness is not authority and does not override F01. Exact commands/typed runtime-derived hash and measured-role slots are in RECEIPT.json. Publication count must use actually observed prior6..26 retired starts plus helper self, not reservations/zero. Future32-knownOS/peak3/1800s/64MiBcapture/768MiBlogical-work bounds unchanged; trusted Git internal disk is outside that logical accounting.

Author preparation peak3/authorized2 stays historical HOLD. This independent peak3 grant cannot amend it. Old draft windows/undefined-path failure remain preserved. No actual authorization issued. Known roles planned through this publication20 (including two instruction-only readers, four metadata readers, patches, syntax, Git and one PURE helper), direct peak2 within3. No universal transitive census claim.

